  "_mode_help": "Topology mode — one of: single | independent | cluster. See references/topology-modes.md. 'single' = one server. 'independent' = several servers, each its own Dokploy panel (own dokploy_url+key per servers entry). 'cluster' = one panel managing multiple nodes via serverId (use the 'nodes' map below).",
  "mode": "single",
  "servers": {
